SUMMARY:Tommy Davidson LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DTSTAMP:20260704T105325Z
DTSTART:20260707T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nTommy Davidson is a comedy legend whose career spans over three decad
	es of making audiences laugh across television\, film\, and the stand-up s
	tage. Best known as one of the original cast members of the groundbreaking
	 sketch comedy series In Living Color\, Tommy’s versatility\, energy\, and
	 comedic genius have made him one of the most beloved entertainers of his 
	generation. \nTommy’s film credits include Ace Ventura: Pet Detective\, Bo
	oty Call\, Bamboozled\, and Juwanna Mann. He has also appeared in numerous
	 television shows and has released multiple stand-up specials that showcas
	e his incredible range as a performer. \nKnown for his physical comedy\, i
	mpressions\, and ability to find humor in everyday life\, Tommy Davidson d
	elivers a show that is both nostalgic and fresh. His performances are a ma
	sterclass in comedic timing and audience connection. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Tuesday\, July 7\, 2026 \nShow Time: 7:00 PM HST (Doors open at 5:00 PM)
	 \nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Ave\, Honolulu\, HI 96815 \nClu
	b Policy: $20 food or beverage minimum per person. Seating is first come\,
	 first served. Full bar and full dinner menu available. \nAbout the Venue\
	nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s most celebrated intimate live entertainmen
	t venue\, nestled inside the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort at 2335 Kalaka
	ua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. The venue is renowned for its world-cla
	ss acoustics\, intimate atmosphere\, and exceptional dining and bar servic
	e. \nWith seating options ranging from Premium Seating to Loge Seating & B
	ar Area\, every guest enjoys an up-close experience with the performer. Th
	e venue’s warm\, sophisticated ambiance makes it the perfect setting for a
	 special night out in Waikiki. \nBlue Note Hawaii is located steps from Wa
	ikiki Beach\, making it easy to combine a comedy show with a beautiful Haw
	aiian evening. Parking is available at the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort 
	and nearby public parking structures. \nWhat to Expect\nTommy Davidson’s s
	how at Blue Note Hawaii is a one-night-only event that comedy fans in Hono
	lulu won’t want to miss. The intimate setting of Blue Note Hawaii provides
	 the perfect backdrop for Tommy’s high-energy\, physically expressive come
	dy style. \nExpect a full headline set featuring Tommy’s signature impress
	ions\, physical comedy\, and personal storytelling. Having performed for d
	ecades\, Tommy knows how to read a room and deliver a performance that fee
	ls both polished and spontaneous. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see a tr
	ue comedy legend up close in one of Honolulu’s most intimate and prestigio
	us venues. Tickets are limited and expected to sell out quickly. \nTicket 
	Information\nPrice Range: From $141 (resale market) \nSecure your seats no
	w through the official ticket link or find resale tickets through VividSea
	ts. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/t
	ommy-davidson-live-at-blue-note-hawaii/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tommy-davidson-live-at-blue-note-hawai
	i/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, 
	United States
