DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nRondell Sheridan LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Clu
	b\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughs as Rondell Sheridan takes the 
	stage at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside the MGM Grand in Las Vegas. Kno
	wn for his sharp wit and high-energy performances\, Rondell Sheridan deliv
	ers a stand-up experience you won’t want to miss. Joining him is comedian 
	Matt Kirshen for an unforgettable evening of comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Tuesday\, July 7\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy 
	Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Requi
	rement: 18+ (Must be 18 or over to attend)\nParking: Available at MGM Gran
	d (fees may apply) \nAbout Rondell Sheridan\nRondell Sheridan is a veteran
	 stand-up comedian and actor best known for his role as Victor Baxter on t
	he hit Disney Channel series That’s So Raven. With decades of experience i
	n stand-up comedy\, Sheridan has performed at clubs and theaters across th
	e country\, earning a reputation for his relatable humor and infectious en
	ergy. His comedy blends observational wit with personal storytelling that 
	resonates with audiences of all ages. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stan
	d-up comedy from a seasoned veteran\nHilarious observational humor and per
	sonal stories\nSpecial performance by comedian Matt Kirshen\nIntimate come
	dy club atmosphere at the MGM Grand\n18+ show with adult content\nBest ava
	ilable seating within purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s 
	Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand Hotel and Casino on the Las Ve
	gas Strip. The club offers an intimate setting with top-tier comedians per
	forming nightly. Seating is best available within the zone purchased and i
	s not assigned in advance. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $111. 
	There is an overall 8 ticket limit for this event. All performers are subj
	ect to change without notice. Seats are NOT assigned — seating is best ava
	ilable within the zone purchased upon arrival. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale 
	Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you 
	purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales ar
	e final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for 
	entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/rondell-sheridan-live-at-brads-
	comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/rondell-sheridan-live-at-brads-comedy-
	club/
