SUMMARY:Gabriel Rutledge LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260704T105325Z
DTSTART:20260708T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Gabriel Rutledge\nGabrie
	l Rutledge is a nationally touring stand-up comedian with a reputation for
	 being a quick-thinking\, fast-talking\, hard-working performer who consis
	tently delivers. A past winner of both the prestigious Seattle Internation
	al Comedy Competition and the Laughing Skull Comedy Festival in Atlanta\, 
	Rutledge has established himself as one of the most reliable headliners on
	 the comedy circuit. \nHis comedy style is sharp\, relatable\, and grounde
	d in real life — drawing from marriage\, family\, and the everyday absurdi
	ties of modern existence. Gabriel has a gift for finding the funny in the 
	mundane and turning it into comedy gold that resonates with audiences of a
	ll backgrounds. \nGabriel has made numerous television appearances includi
	ng Comedy Central’s Live at Gotham\, Nickelodeon’s Nickmom Night Out\, Lau
	ghs on FOX\, and Inside Joke streaming on Amazon Prime Video. His Dry Bar 
	Comedy special “A Third of the Room” and his YouTube special “Nectarine” h
	ave garnered millions of views online. He is also the author of the book “
	Happiness Isn’t Funny: True Stories of a Road Comic.” \nEvent Details\nDat
	e: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM 
	CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Ant
	onio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: $20 – $25 (plu
	s fees) \nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s
	 premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North 
	Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only minutes from 
	the airport. The intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere wher
	e every seat feels close to the action. \nThe venue features tiered seatin
	g sections including Preferred center-stage tables and General Admission s
	ide-stage tables — all first come\, first served within each section. The 
	full-service bar lounge is the perfect place to grab a drink before the sh
	ow\, and the two-item food or beverage minimum per person ensures a full d
	ining experience during the performance. \nWith a capacity designed for an
	 intimate comedy experience\, the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club delivers a cl
	ose-up\, personal show environment that larger arenas simply can’t match. 
	Parking is available in the Park North Plaza lot. The venue enforces an 18
	% service charge on all checks in the showroom. \nWhat to Expect\nGabriel 
	Rutledge’s live show is a masterclass in conversational stand-up comedy. H
	is style is warm\, witty\, and deeply relatable — the kind of comedy that 
	makes you feel like you’re hanging out with a hilarious friend who just ha
	ppens to be incredibly funny. \nThis is a solo headlining performance in t
	he intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. Expect sharp observ
	ations about everyday life\, marriage\, and the human condition delivered 
	with impeccable timing and genuine charm. Gabriel’s award-winning comedy c
	hops shine brightest in a club setting like this one. \nPlease note this i
	s an 18+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. A two-item 
	food or beverage minimum per person applies once seated. \nTicket Informat
	ion\nPrice Range: $20 – $25 per ticket (plus fees)\nPreferred Seating (cen
	ter stage): $25 (+fees)\nGeneral Admission (side stage): $20 (+fees) \nTic
	kets are affordably priced for this award-winning comedian — grab yours be
	fore they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains 
	affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttp
	s://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-rutledge-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comed
	y-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-rutledge-live-at-laugh-out-lou
	d-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\
	, TX\, 78216\, USA
