SUMMARY:Nate Jackson Big Dog Tour LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii (Late Show)
DTSTAMP:20260704T105325Z
DTSTART:20260708T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nNate Jackson Big Dog Tour LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
	 (Late Show)\nNate Jackson\, one of the fastest-rising stars in stand-up c
	omedy\, brings his electrifying Big Dog Tour to the intimate Blue Note Haw
	aii in Honolulu. With over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 million gl
	obal views\, Jackson delivers sharp crowd work and fearless comedy that le
	aves audiences in stitches. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 20
	26\nTime: 9:00 PM (Late Show)\nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\nAddress: 2335 Kala
	kaua Ave\, Honolulu\, HI 96815\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID requi
	red)\nFood/Beverage Minimum: $20 per person\nSeating: Communal & First Com
	e\, First Served \nAbout Nate Jackson\nNate Jackson is a viral comedy sens
	ation with over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 million global views.
	 In 2025\, he released his first one-hour Netflix special\, Nate Jackson: 
	Super Funny\, which premiered at #3 on the Netflix Top 10. He is currently
	 shooting season 2 of Apple’s Bad Monkey and recently appeared alongside K
	eanu Reeves\, Seth Rogen\, and Keke Palmer in Aziz Ansari’s Good Fortune. 
	\nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a Netflix-featured he
	adliner\nSharp crowd work and fearless\, taboo-busting material\nHosted by
	 Trenton Cotten\, featuring Pepper Lamb\nIntimate club setting with full b
	ar and dinner menu\nAn unforgettable late-night show in Waikiki\n\nVenue I
	nformation\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s premier jazz and comedy club\, 
	located at 2335 Kalakaua Ave in the heart of Waikiki. The venue offers a f
	ull bar\, dinner menu\, and an intimate atmosphere perfect for live perfor
	mances. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $40.51 – $63.09. A $20 fo
	od or beverage minimum per person applies. No refunds or exchanges. All sa
	les are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our lin
	ks at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to c
	hange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/nate-jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-late-show/\n
	\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue
	-note-hawaii-late-show/
